// V4.18 — logical aspect snapping.
// A portrait preset stored as 608×1080 is the nearest integer raster to 9:16,
// but 1080 * 9 / 16 = 607.5. Exact 9:16 media therefore used to be fitted to
// 607.5×1080 and could expose ~0.25 px of project background on each side after
// browser/canvas antialiasing. Keep the integer project raster, but treat the
// declared ratio as the logical composition aspect and snap only sub-pixel
// near-matches to the full project rectangle.
